<title>GUAM: U.S. experts say speculation premature in KAL crash.</title>
<headline>U.S. experts say speculation premature in KAL crash.</headline>
<dateline>AGANA, Guam 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. transportation safety investigators who surveyed the crash site of a Korean Air Lines jumbo jet on Thursday and said it was too early to determine the tragedy's cause.</p>
<p>&quot;It is really too early to speculate the cause of this accident,&quot; George Black, a member of the National Transportation Safety Board (NTSB) and chairman of the committee investigating the crash, told a news conference.</p>
</text>
